      "title": {
        "en": "Na jak długo?"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Reception asks five things: *jaki?* (what kind?), *z czym?* (with what?), *od kiedy?* (from when?), *na jak długo?* (for how long?) and *na którym piętrze?* (on which floor?). A hotel counts *doba*, a day and a night: *jedna noc*, *dwie noce*, *trzy noce*. From a day is *od* and until is *do*, with the genitive: *od środy do piątku*."
      },
      "table": {
        "title": {
          "en": "Pokój w hotelu"
        },
        "columns": [
          {
            "header": "pytanie"
          },
          {
            "header": "odpowiedź"
          }
        ],
        "rows": [
          {
